Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Watching Quantum Things: A Build-It-Yourself Catalog of Open-System \
Simulations\
\>", "Title",
 CellID->874461601,ExpressionUUID->"22a1a762-10e3-861e-525e-3f4ca097ed64"],

Cell["\<\
A single, self-contained tour of twenty small open quantum systems, from \
master equations for the unconditioned average to monitored trajectories and \
feedback, each built from plain matrices, computed on the spot, and shown as \
a picture.\
\>", "Subtitle",
 CellID->36768919,ExpressionUUID->"4da796ef-9f57-a4bf-7b5c-0fc91ae30e85"],

Cell["Mads Bahrami", "Author",
 CellID->1699946459,ExpressionUUID->"1b39f900-6440-cee7-4ac6-f16a0dfa94cd"],

Cell["Wolfram Research, Inc.", "Affiliation",
 CellID->1535504786,ExpressionUUID->"75d93363-5da6-51a4-23e6-ab4d5453238e"],

Cell["\<\
This computational essay is a hands-on tour of open quantum systems: systems \
that leak energy or information to their environment, watched by a detector \
on the output. We build a driven atom relaxing to its steady state, light in \
a leaky cavity, a superposition that decoheres almost the instant it forms, \
an atom whose fluorescence we read first as single photons and then as a \
homodyne current, a mechanical resonator cooled by measurement and feedback, \
and a dozen more. Each becomes a few lines of code you can run and change, \
and each ends in a picture.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1208482393,ExpressionUUID->"25a568a6-87a2-527f-535a-810032572145"],

Cell["\<\
Two notes on style. First, the file stands on its own: the mathematics, \
simulation helpers, and plotting code it needs are defined below, using \
Wolfram Language. Second, I use the standard names (density matrix, Bloch \
vector, master equation, dissipator, coherent state) and explain each in one \
plain sentence the first time it appears; the code uses the same standard \
names, so it reads like the physics. It is a live notebook, so evaluate the \
cells from top to bottom, because later cells lean on earlier ones. You do \
not have to read every tool to follow the physics, though: if you would \
rather learn the code from the examples, run the definitions in \"The \
Toolkit: Everything the Twenty Examples Share\" without studying them and \
dive into that part only when you want the implementation. Look at each \
output and what it means before picking apart the code that made it. And you \
are not locked into anything: change a number, watch a different system, \
reseed the randomness, and see what moves. That is the whole point.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->28909615,ExpressionUUID->"00d7f70d-8d0e-ae34-30ec-ef5724b8f51e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "I wrote this essay assuming you know three ideas. First, the state is a ",
 StyleBox["density matrix",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2f3e8453-9762-68ea-56c5-1e1d22173a30"],
 ": an ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[Times]", 
   StyleBox["n", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5902d484-617f-9570-0f31-cdee100bfc5a"],
 " Hermitian, positive-semidefinite matrix (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "56e0e12c-de7d-6135-7e9f-f889db08301f"],
 " is number of levels, 2 for a qubit, more for an oscillator), with \
nonnegative level populations on its diagonal (summing to one) and the \
coherences off-diagonal. Second, the system has a Hamiltonian ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["H", "TI"], "^"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5708d032-2150-04f2-7d37-ca7c50e56ed8"],
 " that drives its unitary evolution when left alone. Third, one random \
quantity recurs below: the Wiener increment ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3b7807e8-9504-b25a-6907-9eb21cb600a0"],
 ", a Gaussian random step with variance equal to the time step ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "t"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "166f8969-5e31-e8e5-3e14-21335bc5bacf"],
 ". Where the pace steepens I will say so."
}], "Text",
 CellID->193832008,ExpressionUUID->"234f1fb7-07c6-bba9-5174-96f1b27009f3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We set ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ee45b93-a0df-d1f6-169c-52dcd16ba3dc"],
 " throughout, so every rate and frequency is in units of inverse time."
}], "Text",
 CellID->684317082,ExpressionUUID->"0a3edd72-e0d3-62fb-3bc5-d53f916630c1"],

Cell["Let's start!", "Text",
 CellID->528485616,ExpressionUUID->"6ec9a758-58be-624c-16f6-3f02594b3096"],

Cell["In Standard Notation: The Twenty Governing Equations", "Section",
 CellID->1392207227,ExpressionUUID->"23253b8d-1c99-a6bf-52da-b2d7952d0c85"],

Cell["\<\
Before building anything, here is the catalog stated formally: the standard \
notation every example uses, then all twenty governing equations on one page. \
Skim it now and return to it later; nothing here needs memorizing on a first \
pass. The toolkit in the next section builds each of these objects as \
runnable code and the examples work them one at a time, so meeting the \
equations first means you already know the formal object each tool stands for.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->705466992,ExpressionUUID->"6e84829b-9667-6594-16bb-1bc523124ffe"],

Cell["The machinery, in standard notation", "Subsection",
 CellID->1350516518,ExpressionUUID->"569e173f-6b36-b240-7ea5-8f790ec000aa"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Every example below opens with a one-line statement of its problem in \
standard notation, so the formal problem and the plain solution sit side by \
side. These are the symbols that statement uses. The state is the density \
matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "15a3e88e-0b57-fa6e-4350-01e8aee3c8b4"],
 "; the averaged evolution is the ",
 StyleBox["master equation",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",
 CellID->907546795,ExpressionUUID->"779c57de-bb93-d239-1da4-4e983e27a103"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "."], "=", "\[ScriptCapitalL]", 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", "-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["H", "TI"], "^"], ",", 
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
    UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->False], "\|01d49f", 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "=", "1"}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->814772321,ExpressionUUID->"2867ea9b-6e8d-517b-581c-03c50b382041"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "with a Hamiltonian part ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"-", 
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["H", "TI"], "^"], ",", 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76dfbc62-92ac-7b6e-1ee4-364c275949b4"],
 " and one ",
 StyleBox["dissipator",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " per leak channel,"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1054628905,ExpressionUUID->"0df4b6a5-173c-e15a-3b8b-2f0fa2ceb3a0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\|01d49f", 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], "-", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], 
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "+", 
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], 
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"]}], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], "."}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->2043779557,ExpressionUUID->"4d620fc7-5cf2-d9d8-7b11-a6a15484ab22"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For a qubit the ",
 StyleBox["Bloch vector",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["y", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     SubscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
      StyleBox["x", "TI"]], 
     StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     SubscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
      StyleBox["y", "TI"]], 
     StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     SubscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
      StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
     StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "741b091d-feb2-1a39-1c38-a146fb476903"],
 ", with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"\|01d7d9", "+", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "+", 
    StyleBox["y", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["y", "TI"]], "+", 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["z", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3bf5a20e-c541-e06e-698a-446becf5b2b4"],
 "; the lowering operator is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], "-"], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
     "Ket"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
     "Bra"]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "07964fa7-8d1e-ff14-2dae-660124a8c27e"],
 ", and for an oscillator the annihilation operator is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3e367b18-9aa8-58f9-67ce-73421f5d2ac3"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"]}], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1dbaaaf7-1388-e538-4b59-43b1a622cc02"],
 ". When the record is kept, the state follows a ",
 StyleBox["stochastic master equation",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " whose measurement (diffusion) term for a monitored ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "77d99fdb-a351-2d53-1de6-1684d6e477b9"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[ScriptCapitalH]", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "+", 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], "-", 
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "+", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"]}], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "04646437-faee-7dfc-2c1c-7e70fe9b47c6"],
 ", driven by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1cbde497-e826-5557-4442-fdd089d33fbd"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], "2"], "=", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ecb37d0-fbcc-3e82-16c8-ae9dfe7e84e8"],
 "; photon counting instead applies the jump ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\|01d4a2", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], "/", 
   StyleBox["Tr",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"]}], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "-", 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c358d3e-86d3-ec5f-75ca-25783367b6a5"],
 " at click times."
}], "Text",
 CellID->17830494,ExpressionUUID->"1f908cf3-3c70-d55a-45af-25bdb50abfa0"],

Cell["The Twenty Governing Equations, at a Glance", "Subsection",
 CellID->1589986527,ExpressionUUID->"5dac66ba-272d-3627-0b54-7fe452d99d0d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Here is the dynamics of every example in one place. All stochastic \
equations are It\[OHat] equations. For a Hermitian observable ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["M", "TI"], "^"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "110914de-bbdd-83a1-4736-8d983e69d18b"],
 " monitored through ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "=", 
   SqrtBox[
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["M", "TI"], "^"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76d004f9-29e5-6665-1eef-9da34f904d4f"],
 ", the catalog uses"
}], "Text",
 CellID->943101875,ExpressionUUID->"2c76c797-c249-79ca-540d-ded0f7fc4b10"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], "\|01d49f", 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["M", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", "-", 
    FractionBox[
     StyleBox["k", "TI"], "2"], 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["M", "TI"], "^"], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["[",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      RowBox[{
       OverscriptBox[
        StyleBox["M", "TI"], "^"], ",", 
       StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], 
      StyleBox["]",
       SpanMaxSize->1]}]}], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"d", "J"}], "TI"], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"2", 
      SqrtBox[
       StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      SubscriptBox[
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
         SpanMaxSize->1], 
        OverscriptBox[
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], "^"], 
        StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
         SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
       StyleBox["c", "TI"]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["t", "TI"]}], "+", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]}]}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->67888809,ExpressionUUID->"35077f55-9291-6519-633d-771f27244c63"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4ebf3687-f906-130d-7644-afe0f8b37e57"],
 " is the coefficient carried by the monitored operator ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["M", "TI"], "^"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "65de4a87-3471-cd9f-13e6-63e1bd0597e5"],
 ". Equivalently, the rescaled record ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["y", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["J", "TI"], "/", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SqrtBox[
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7bedd9bd-1d84-ddaa-2992-d0e79436a7f0"],
 " obeys ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["y", "TI"], "=", 
   SubscriptBox[
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["M", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["W", "TI"], "/", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SqrtBox[
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c37f35a-e1a6-07fe-75cc-eb0790536dc4"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1432876021,ExpressionUUID->"02f88238-86c8-66df-3287-2462337d4c25"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Pure dephasing.",
 FontWeight->"Bold"]], "ItemNumbered",
 CellID->876231958,ExpressionUUID->"034d641c-5834-e412-3173-7e4659c6cf78"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "."], "=", 
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "\|01d49f", 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], "."], ",", 
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["y", "TI"], "."], ",", 
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["z", "TI"], "."]}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["(",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "2", 
