 CellLabel->"In[79]:= ",
 CellID->376345483,ExpressionUUID->"25f1a39a-81e0-db80-538e-3ac4379aa9ea"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The thin gray lines in each panel are the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["W", "TI"], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "35466be2-b7a8-26dc-637d-82cfc2428c26"],
 " contour, where the Wigner function changes sign: the negative (blue) \
patches of quantum interference lie inside them."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1917523023,ExpressionUUID->"58bdea72-0ba3-5f4c-0842-0c3cae562596"],

Cell["\<\
At first there are two Gaussian lobes (the two coherent states) with \
interference fringes between them: the fringes are the coherence, the \
off-diagonal cross-term. Across this short window the fringes fade fast while \
the lobes barely shrink: the cat is collapsing toward a classical mixture of \
the two coherent states while both are still nearly full size. Decoherence is \
far faster than energy loss.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->225924774,ExpressionUUID->"6e8cef58-e908-949c-16b3-070588a2fee6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "How fast? The coherence ",
 Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
    {
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["(",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
      StyleBox[")",
       SpanMaxSize->1]}]}
   },
   GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
   GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0abc4047-6c7b-4886-3a44-5a21050e1aec"],
 " is the closed-form envelope from the problem statement, and the master \
equation can be made to report the same quantity on its own. Evolve the cat \
once over the plotted span:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1508526016,ExpressionUUID->"24e21d63-fe6b-5877-4c91-954cfb1e2b5d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"catRun", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"evolveODE", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"0", " ", "blankCat"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Gamma]cat", "]"}], " ", "downCat"}], "}"}], ",",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{"densityMatrix", "[", "cat", "]"}], ",", " ", "2."}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[80]:= ",
 CellID->1653333794,ExpressionUUID->"348d2737-4aeb-e3cb-5cb2-bf716e9fb111"],

Cell["\<\
Under amplitude damping the state stays in the span of its two shrinking \
lobes, so it keeps the form\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->2117504204,ExpressionUUID->"2161c865-0900-0907-571e-e24fa8b5586d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["(",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
      StyleBox[")",
       SpanMaxSize->1]}]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         TemplateBox[{
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]]},
          "Ket"], 
         TemplateBox[{
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]]},
          "Bra"]}], "+", 
        RowBox[{
         TemplateBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["t", "TI"]]}]},
          "Ket"], 
         TemplateBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["t", "TI"]]}]},
          "Bra"]}]}], ")"}]}], "+", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         TemplateBox[{
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]]},
          "Ket"], 
         TemplateBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["t", "TI"]]}]},
          "Bra"]}], "+", 
        RowBox[{
         TemplateBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["t", "TI"]]}]},
          "Ket"], 
         TemplateBox[{
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]]},
          "Bra"]}]}], ")"}]}]}]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["t", "TI"]], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["t", "TI"], "/", "2"}]]}]}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->201091240,ExpressionUUID->"3cadbe4b-a339-c651-6452-3014d6cdacbb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "and the coherence is the weight ratio ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{GridBox[{
     {
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["(",
        SpanMaxSize->1], 
       StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
       StyleBox[")",
        SpanMaxSize->1]}]}
    },
    GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}], "=", 
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], "/", 
   StyleBox["p", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "31169419-f57b-983b-672d-0e42fc0feb01"],
 ". The two lobes are not orthogonal (they overlap by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["o", "TI"], "=", 
   TemplateBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["t", "TI"]], 
     RowBox[{"-", 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["t", "TI"]]}]},
    "BraKet"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "40aa99e8-53bd-499c-70a9-10b266481be6"],
 "), so read ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["p", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5d165407-aaf3-867b-0b2e-4e60ce87ed41"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["c", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "75cb8946-a0dc-0da7-23c8-2123d169578d"],
 " off two matrix elements of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "63688a50-35e7-99e6-1117-2c1a4393ebcc"],
 " by undoing that overlap with a two-by-two linear solve:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->667003370,ExpressionUUID->"12187c95-2034-8b29-4238-75df51c6d673"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"catCoherence", "[", 
    RowBox[{"t_", "?", "NumericQ"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "va", ",", " ", "vb", ",", " ", "o", ",", " ", "m1", ",", " ", "m2", ",",
        " ", "p", ",", " ", "cc"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"va", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
        RowBox[{"topCat", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "\[Gamma]cat"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"t", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"vb", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
        RowBox[{"topCat", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "\[Alpha]"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "\[Gamma]cat"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"t", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"o", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "va", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "vb"}], 
        "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"m1", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "va", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"catRun", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "va"}], "]"}]}], ";",
       " ", 
      RowBox[{"m2", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "va", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"catRun", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "vb"}], "]"}]}], ";",
       "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"p", ",", " ", "cc"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"LinearSolve", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
              RowBox[{"o", "^", "2"}]}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"2", " ", "o"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"2", " ", "o"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
              RowBox[{"o", "^", "2"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"m1", ",", " ", "m2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      
      RowBox[{"cc", "/", "p"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[81]:= ",
 CellID->526043023,ExpressionUUID->"34b193bd-0a67-a7a6-5c4e-0ae7af130d8c"],

Cell["\<\
Now visualize both, the closed-form envelope and the master-equation \
extraction, for our chosen separation:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1120596176,ExpressionUUID->"4fca8ec2-4b73-3b52-75c9-27ac6e0789b8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "2"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "^", "2"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "\[Gamma]cat"}], " ", "t"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}], 
     ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"catCoherence", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"ColorData", "[", 
       RowBox[{"97", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ColorData", "[", 
         RowBox[{"97", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "Dashed"}], "]"}]}], 
     "}"}]}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<closed form\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<master equation\>\""}], 
     "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<time\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<coherence |C(t)|\>\""}], "}"}]}], 
   ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
    " ", "\"\<master-equation coherence lies on the closed-form \
envelope\>\""}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[82]:= ",
 CellID->64105026,ExpressionUUID->"656925a1-dac3-d209-1316-bc0adf77a153"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The dashed master-equation extraction lies on the closed form within the \
displayed numerical tolerance. The envelope is the exact infinite-dimensional \
amplitude-damping law; the finite Fock simulation approaches it as its cutoff \
and solver accuracy are increased. The decoherence rate grows as the ",
 StyleBox["square", "TI"],
 " of the separation, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[GridBox[{
      {
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "-", 
        StyleBox["(",
         SpanMaxSize->1], 
        RowBox[{"-", 
         StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]}], 
        StyleBox[")",
         SpanMaxSize->1]}]}
     },
     GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
     GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}], "2"], "=", "4", 
   SuperscriptBox[GridBox[{
      {
       StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]}
     },
     GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
     GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "09e13884-5cc5-f650-3f9e-b1ee5571dcba"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1373525465,ExpressionUUID->"29829495-262a-abaa-5fb1-0ddf53dcf9f0"],

Cell["\<\
Every Fock-space example truncates the infinite number-state ladder at a \
finite cutoff, so each needs a check that the cutoff is high enough not to \
change the answer. Recompute the mean photon number of a decaying coherent \
state at cutoffs 20, 30, and 40:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1964307623,ExpressionUUID->"136212ad-a4c2-b9f3-4111-8bf6cd740bd9"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"observable", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
      RowBox[{"nn", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"expectation", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"creation", "[", "nn", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
          RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", "nn", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"evolve", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"0", " ", 
            RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "nn", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Gamma]cat", "]"}], " ", 
             RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", "nn", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"densityMatrix", "[", 
            RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
             RowBox[{"nn", ",", " ", "2."}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "0.5"}], 
          "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"observable", " ", "/@", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"20", ",", " ", "30", ",", " ", "40"}], "}"}]}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[83]:= ",
 CellID->39040159,ExpressionUUID->"67f6b273-a0bf-ee61-0d8d-343cd14bb54b"],

Cell["\<\
The three values are numerically indistinguishable at the shown precision. \
This bounds, rather than eliminates, the truncation error: for this \
observable and state, raising the dimension beyond 20 changes the result by \
less than the displayed tolerance.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1242473813,ExpressionUUID->"07a2a6c0-d7ac-3784-2d51-3fade25e9dee"],

Cell["Making a Cat With an Atom, and Reading Its Decoherence", "Subsection",
 CellID->290269587,ExpressionUUID->"7d29df82-54ab-6c21-24d6-d6ec5d5e370b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The problem.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " A ",
 StyleBox["far-detuned", "TI"],
 " atom, its transition frequency sitting far from the cavity's so it can \
trade no energy with the light and only turns its phase, imprints a \
state-dependent phase shift under"
}], "Text",
 CellID->471335900,ExpressionUUID->"2673b224-f5d9-a24c-4e00-2b81fc6df096"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["H", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["C", "TI"]], "=", 
    StyleBox["\[Chi]", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["z", "TI"]]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]},
     "Ket"], "\[Rule]", 
    TemplateBox[{
      RowBox[{
        StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"\[PlusMinus]", 
           StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]]}]},
     "Ket"]}], ",", "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[Chi]", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Tau]", "TI"], "."}]}]}]}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->1843091513,ExpressionUUID->"27388ee6-22a7-f122-4ec7-27c05753c008"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "An atom prepared in the equal superposition ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
      "Ket"], "+", 
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
      "Ket"]}], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], "/", 
   SqrtBox["2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "51cd4bfd-d3fa-9dcf-07f3-62a6e58ce715"],
 " therefore leaves the field in a two-phase ",
 StyleBox["cat",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"-", 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]]}]},
    "Ket"], "+", 
   TemplateBox[{
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"+", 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]]}]},
    "Ket"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "06a776cb-b9d0-3c58-2e5d-6f95386a86a2"],
 ", entangled with the atom. After the cat decoheres for a delay (the leak of \
the last example), a second atom probes the same field, and the two-atom \
correlation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], "2"], 
    StyleBox["|",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], "1"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "-", 
   StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], "2"], 
    StyleBox["|",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], "1"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7641b941-63e8-8619-1e7e-312b1582ed63"],
 " (the second atom's chance of coming out excited when the first did, minus \
when the first came out in the ground state) is nonzero only while the field \
keeps its coherence, so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["\[Tau]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "42b8cf72-fa81-ffe6-7247-e73fff35c5cc"],
 " tracks the surviving coherence ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["\[Tau]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1c8db7a0-3aa3-299f-44b2-2e0abf567be5"],
 " and falls to zero as the cat blurs into a mixture. This is the ",
 ButtonBox["Haroche experiment",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/PhysRevLett.77.4887"], None}],
 "; build the atom-made cat and measure how fast the correlation dies."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1978684664,ExpressionUUID->"473593be-64fb-e664-6eca-0af80c8fcd4e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In plainer terms, the atom is a phase stamp, not an absorber: far off \
resonance it takes no photon from the field, it only rotates the field's \
phase by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"+", 
   StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "79a8e286-b760-8808-2f57-fbe3c21adb52"],
 " or ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"-", 
   StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "766f3dde-6e6e-8ae3-1e14-b4980b18d8c9"],
 " according to its state, so an atom in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
      "Ket"], "+", 
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
      "Ket"]}], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], "/", 
   SqrtBox["2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7acff19c-f8f8-c05b-2af4-e8d9f97292a1"],
 " leaves the two phase-rotated fields superposed and entangled with it. One \
probe atom cannot reveal this coherence, since its own outcome averages over \
the two phases; only the correlation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "36bb0aa4-099e-3511-5e58-a30ea8289c7b"],
 " between two atoms reading the same field exposes it, and only while it \
survives."
}], "Text",
 CellID->2064137570,ExpressionUUID->"6fab4322-7f5b-c123-15a9-5a8c7aef9009"],

Cell["\<\
The protocol runs as a fixed sequence: the first atom writes the cat onto the \
field, a delay lets it decohere, and the second atom reads it back. The grid \
below is that arc as a chain of states, one line per operation, running from \
the initial coherent field through the written cat and its decoherence to the \
final two-atom readout. Reading the first atom is what conditions the cat \
into being; discard its record instead and the field is left a diagonal \
mixture of the two phase-pointers, no cross term and so no fringes.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1265784226,ExpressionUUID->"559c0528-76f1-864e-03a3-9d720285ec94"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     StyleBox["\<\"operation\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      LineColor->GrayLevel[0.4],
      FrontFaceColor->GrayLevel[0.4],
      BackFaceColor->GrayLevel[0.4],
      GraphicsColor->GrayLevel[0.4],
      FontWeight->Bold,
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.4]], 
     StyleBox["\<\"state\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      LineColor->GrayLevel[0.4],
      FrontFaceColor->GrayLevel[0.4],
      BackFaceColor->GrayLevel[0.4],
      GraphicsColor->GrayLevel[0.4],
      FontWeight->Bold,
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.4]]},
    {"\<\"prepare: atom 1 in its ground state, field coherent\"\>", 
     RowBox[{
      TemplateBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["g", "TI"], "1"]},
       "Ket"], 
      TemplateBox[{
        StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]},
       "Ket"]}]},
    {"\<\"Ramsey \[Pi]/2: atom 1 into an equal superposition\"\>", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        TemplateBox[{
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["g", "TI"], "1"]},
         "Ket"], "-", 
        TemplateBox[{
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["e", "TI"], "1"]},
         "Ket"]}], ")"}], 
      TemplateBox[{
        StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]},
       "Ket"]}]},
    {"\<\"dispersive stamp: the field phase records the atom\"\>", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       TemplateBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], "1"]},
        "Ket"], 
       TemplateBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "+"]},
        "Ket"]}], "-", 
      RowBox[{
       TemplateBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["e", "TI"], "1"]},
        "Ket"], 
       TemplateBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "-"]},
        "Ket"]}]}]},
    {"\<\"analysis Ramsey: recombine atom 1's two branches\"\>", 
     TagBox[GridBox[{
        {
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             TemplateBox[{
               SubscriptBox[
                StyleBox["g", "TI"], "1"]},
              "Ket"], "-", 
             TemplateBox[{
               SubscriptBox[
                StyleBox["e", "TI"], "1"]},
              "Ket"]}], ")"}], 
           TemplateBox[{
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "+"]},
            "Ket"]}], "-", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             TemplateBox[{
               SubscriptBox[
                StyleBox["g", "TI"], "1"]},
              "Ket"], "+", 
             TemplateBox[{
               SubscriptBox[
                StyleBox["e", "TI"], "1"]},
              "Ket"]}], ")"}], 
           TemplateBox[{
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "-"]},
            "Ket"]}]}]},
        {
         RowBox[{"\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
          RowBox[{"=", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             TemplateBox[{
               SubscriptBox[
                StyleBox["g", "TI"], "1"]},
              "Ket"], 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
               TemplateBox[{
                 SubscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "+"]},
                "Ket"], "-", 
               TemplateBox[{
                 SubscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "-"]},
                "Ket"]}], ")"}]}], "-", 
            RowBox[{
             TemplateBox[{
               SubscriptBox[
                StyleBox["e", "TI"], "1"]},
              "Ket"], 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
               TemplateBox[{
                 SubscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "+"]},
                "Ket"], "+", 
               TemplateBox[{
                 SubscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "-"]},
                "Ket"]}], ")"}]}]}]}]}]}
       },
       DefaultBaseStyle->"Column",
       GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
       GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}},
       
       GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{0.35}}}],
      "Column"]},
    {"\<\"read atom 1: the cavity is left in a cat\"\>", 
     RowBox[{
      TemplateBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "+"]},
       "Ket"], "\[PlusMinus]", 
      TemplateBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "-"]},
       "Ket"]}]},
    {"\<\"photon loss over the delay \[Tau]\"\>", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["cavity",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      StyleBox["(",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      StyleBox["\[Tau]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox[")",
       SpanMaxSize->1]}]},
    {"\<\"prepare atom 2 (the probe) in its ground state\"\>", 
     RowBox[{
      TemplateBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"]},
       "Ket"], 
      RowBox[{
       TemplateBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"]},
        "Bra"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["cavity",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["(",
        SpanMaxSize->1], 
       StyleBox["\[Tau]", "TI"], 
       StyleBox[")",
        SpanMaxSize->1]}]}]},
    {"\<\"read atom 2: the two-atom correlation\"\>", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["(",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      StyleBox["\[Tau]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox[")",
       SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["(",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], "2"], 
       StyleBox["|",
        SpanMaxSize->1], 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], "1"]}], 
      StyleBox[")",
       SpanMaxSize->1], "-", 
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["(",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], "2"], 
       StyleBox["|",
        SpanMaxSize->1], 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["g", "TI"], "1"]}], 
      StyleBox[")",
       SpanMaxSize->1]}]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   BaseStyle->{FontSize -> 13},
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}, "Rows" -> {{Left}}},
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {{None}}, "RowsIndexed" -> {2 -> GrayLevel[0.65]}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}},
   GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{3.5}}, "Rows" -> {{1.3}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Output",
 CellID->872599864,ExpressionUUID->"4c3b3e9a-7f95-6e09-75d8-b7c47a203553"],

Cell["\<\
Set the cutoff, the cavity decay rate, and the number operator:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->2056057710,ExpressionUUID->"7b834648-1855-f17e-29b1-581299e1c044"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"topHar", " ", "=", " ", "28"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"blankHar", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "topHar", "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"downHar", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", "topHar", "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"numHar", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"creation", "[", "topHar", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "downHar"}]}], ";",
   " ", 
  RowBox[{"\[Gamma]har", " ", "=", " ", "0.5"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[84]:= ",
 CellID->1360523735,ExpressionUUID->"6aa15cf4-f328-f435-1a5f-55b186c2df1f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ",
 StyleBox["trace distance",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["Tr",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], GridBox[{
     {
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "1"], "-", 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "2"]}]}
    },
    GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1fa3178e-7287-38be-4550-8ee807338a84"],
 " will measure how far a field sits from a classical mixture:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->676766013,ExpressionUUID->"33c53063-afff-c489-61fa-aa4cc98baed3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"traceDistance", "[", 
    RowBox[{"a_", ",", " ", "b_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
     RowBox[{"SingularValueList", "[", 
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "-", " ", "b"}], "]"}], "]"}], "/", "2"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[85]:= ",
 CellID->1428640414,ExpressionUUID->"08d8bcb3-70a4-55b3-38e7-35fd01513f99"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Because the singular values of any matrix sum to its trace norm, this is \
exactly ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["Tr",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], GridBox[{
     {
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["a", "TI"], "-", 
       StyleBox["b", "TI"]}]}
    },
    GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "20e38226-5aed-155d-5090-1b805e987fa7"],
 "; for the Hermitian difference of two states those singular values are the \
magnitudes of its eigenvalues."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1143649234,ExpressionUUID->"160727ef-d1b8-0069-3e3c-bec8e04d52b3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Now the machinery that makes the cat with an atom, three pieces on the \
joint atom-cavity space (atom first, cavity second). A ",
 StyleBox["Ramsey ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[Pi]", "/", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"261df1b1-b81e-57af-4e22-e8fb39ab3df5"],
 StyleBox[" pulse",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " rotates the atom by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[Pi]", "/", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "00ba9d2f-c328-50fc-3059-1488f6dd22c6"],
 " about ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["y", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "02964792-f196-8b6e-32ae-5edf8020d9b4"],
 ", turning ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "166d4e5f-4333-9385-3e13-601976c7e1ef"],
 " into an equal superposition. On the joint atom-cavity space it is the \
operator ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"-", 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{"\[Pi]", "/", "4"}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     SubscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
      StyleBox["y", "TI"]]}]], "\[CircleTimes]", 
   SubscriptBox["\|01d7d9", 
    StyleBox["cavity",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1c99ee20-d785-d362-44a6-078de231be48"],
 ", the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[Pi]", "/", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "60858f89-56d8-6615-10ba-26d3636d4d7f"],
 " rotation appearing as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[Pi]", "/", "4"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2e45545e-c429-efe4-567b-4e1bedddb5ce"],
 " in the exponent since the generator turns the state by twice its angle:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1571962290,ExpressionUUID->"24564246-a2b2-7a9b-4c6e-6423d74748e1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ramsey", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "4"}], ")"}], " ", "Y"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     "blankHar"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[86]:= ",
 CellID->2091585593,ExpressionUUID->"273d1382-afb1-09c0-4ec2-8aefca445b2a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ",
 StyleBox["dispersive interaction",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["z", "TI"]]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "39c9e52f-ed06-87fb-6ff6-fc8884b0edc1"],
 " rotates the field's phase by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"-", 
   StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "46be6341-4be3-06d9-6e46-7b2b6d966c23"],
 " when the atom is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "352b8971-1d3f-d4c9-6328-213b94cbbe13"],
 " and by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"+", 
   StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "227c7e4b-1c68-aac8-5204-70159502f812"],
 " when it is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6cd9b5a9-dbed-51da-14e6-2cf2dd982320"],
 ", the phase stamp of the problem statement. Since ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4becebe3-5bfe-fac0-7993-02cd5d88c82a"],
 " is diagonal the exponential splits into one field rotation per atom state, \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
     "Ket"], 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
      "Bra"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        OverscriptBox[
         StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], 
       OverscriptBox[
        StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"]}]]}]}], "+", 
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
     "Ket"], 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
      "Bra"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
      RowBox[{"+", 
       StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        OverscriptBox[
         StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], 
       OverscriptBox[
        StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"]}]]}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "312d182f-c6c7-5e1e-60d2-9188f3722564"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->30157833,ExpressionUUID->"1449d45f-8382-90b9-3c76-ce193634e283"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"disperse", "[", "\[Phi]_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "\[Phi]", " ", "numHar"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], 
    " ", "+", " ", 
    RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
       RowBox[{"I", " ", "\[Phi]", " ", "numHar"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[87]:= ",
 CellID->1715653387,ExpressionUUID->"444f09dd-766a-dba7-6c74-a087031ca98d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "And a function returning the cavity conditioned on finding the atom in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "79e9b65a-67eb-1624-2f96-2804119e7d0e"],
 " (block 1) or ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "394df0e2-3b3f-7a44-6f72-e9ccbeca48ae"],
 " (block 2): the partial matrix element ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     StyleBox["s", "TI"]},
    "Bra"], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
   TemplateBox[{
     StyleBox["s", "TI"]},
    "Ket"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5d3de1d4-e864-19c9-04c2-f89189116b13"],
 " over the atom state ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["s", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1adc8861-0296-99d3-4ae3-224bb720eb39"],
 ", which brackets only the atom and leaves the atom's diagonal block of the \
joint ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "47f3727e-1788-b883-6d81-7438a2220ae9"],
 ", a cavity operator whose trace is the probability of that outcome:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1904268993,ExpressionUUID->"02bfa0ec-e0fe-2fa7-3244-39c9908b758d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"cavityGiven", "[", 
    RowBox[{"joint_", ",", " ", "s_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"r", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"ArrayReshape", "[", 
        RowBox[{"joint", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
          "2", ",", " ", "topHar", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "topHar"}], 
          "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"r", "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", 
       RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", "All", ",", " ", "s", ",", " ", "All"}], "]"}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[88]:= ",
 CellID->1610510011,ExpressionUUID->"7cc1833e-1ead-5711-24fe-1b789b583a7b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Start the atom in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3cb4236e-91b2-9328-644b-bb482044fe72"],
 " and the cavity in the coherent state of amplitude ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "=", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "631da35c-735e-7e3b-1122-3b0606eb4501"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1363210520,ExpressionUUID->"44b7daea-ed84-b50e-6c4c-d3b784361c54"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"jointStart", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"densityMatrix", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Flatten", "@", 
     RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
      RowBox[{"ground", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
        RowBox[{"topHar", ",", " ", "2."}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[89]:= ",
 CellID->751311520,ExpressionUUID->"39f2334d-24de-3dcb-6f81-ab174d688711"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Ramsey the atom into a superposition, then let the dispersive interaction \
entangle them at phase ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1ec600b7-0050-8550-46fd-99f1b1eaefba"],
 ". Applied to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
    "Ket"], 
   TemplateBox[{
     StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]},
    "Ket"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "33bfe66e-cd59-d601-6144-f84be4edbd6b"],
 " the two together produce the pure state ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Psi]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]},
    "Ket"], 
   TemplateBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Psi]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]},
    "Bra"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6a3ee8c1-8740-e1ad-1bc5-01ab32fab3f7"],
 " with"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1811324800,ExpressionUUID->"33885b0f-111a-0c54-6188-5369a0af56be"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Psi]", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]},
     "Ket"], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox["1", 
      SqrtBox["2"]], 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        TemplateBox[{
          StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
         "Ket"], 
        TemplateBox[{
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "+"]},
         "Ket"]}], "-", 
       RowBox[{
        TemplateBox[{
          StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
         "Ket"], 
        TemplateBox[{
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "-"]},
         "Ket"]}]}], ")"}]}]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "\[PlusMinus]"], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
      RowBox[{"\[PlusMinus]", 
       StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]]}]}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->1255352889,ExpressionUUID->"5c9080a8-67dd-9047-04af-19f21269e2ad"],

Cell["\<\
each atom state now entangled with its own phase-rotated field:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1056550259,ExpressionUUID->"2abc9d06-0494-496b-5a43-1560ad211bb1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"entangle", "[", "\[Phi]_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"U", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"disperse", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"U", " ", ".", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"ramsey", " ", ".", " ", "jointStart", " ", ".", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "ramsey", "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", ".",
       " ", 
      RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "U", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[90]:= ",
 CellID->1554899303,ExpressionUUID->"43e301a0-76bb-1057-7190-980a034e62bd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Here is the step that is easy to skip. If we now ",
 StyleBox["ignore", "TI"],
 " the atom and trace it out, the cavity is not a cat. Tracing out the atom \
sums its two diagonal blocks, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Tr",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["atom",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
      "Bra"], 
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
      "Ket"]}], "+", 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
      "Bra"], 
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
      "Ket"]}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1ae06f2b-7109-3ba5-4a9f-877500bd898f"],
 ", and for the entangled state that collapses to the equal mixture ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      TemplateBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "+"]},
       "Ket"], 
      TemplateBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "+"]},
       "Bra"]}], "+", 
     RowBox[{
      TemplateBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "-"]},
       "Ket"], 
      TemplateBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "-"]},
       "Bra"]}]}], ")"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0856a555-3f58-6085-386d-3d1fbaed32ef"],
 ", no cross term:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1285549060,ExpressionUUID->"71eecbe3-9be0-9ba6-2795-e2cd1d9ae98c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"reducedCavity", "[", "\[Phi]_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"cavityGiven", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"entangle", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}], ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], " ", "+",
     " ", 
    RowBox[{"cavityGiven", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"entangle", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}], ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}]}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[91]:= ",
 CellID->1616846310,ExpressionUUID->"59070895-187c-42ea-0f3c-a1df99091030"],

Cell["Read its purity:", "Text",
 CellID->1706199142,ExpressionUUID->"189fe470-6cd8-7cf4-48a4-fe3a056d46de"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"purity", "[", 
  RowBox[{"reducedCavity", "[", "1.3", "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[92]:= ",
 CellID->848974671,ExpressionUUID->"04ed2843-d86c-272a-2c92-c22cd91e8a70"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "against the pure cat ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[Proportional]", 
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "-"]},
     "Ket"], "+", 
    TemplateBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "+"]},
     "Ket"]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "70d9e217-b7c7-416b-20e6-0450c27213b1"],
 " the naive picture would insert by hand:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1375299215,ExpressionUUID->"29221b72-bc55-8ef4-58d1-933c35e1d4de"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"purity", "[", 
  RowBox[{"densityMatrix", "@", 
   RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
      RowBox[{"topHar", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"2.", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "1.3"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
     RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
      RowBox[{"topHar", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"2.", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
         RowBox[{"I", " ", "1.3"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[93]:= ",
 CellID->1656178105,ExpressionUUID->"41172bde-c012-830e-772c-c29bf1a4ee54"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A half against a one: the unread atom leaves the cavity a ",
 StyleBox["mixture",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " of the two phase-rotated coherent states, not a pure cat. Its Wigner \
function says the same, two lobes with nothing between them:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->2128368636,ExpressionUUID->"3dd84232-0c35-660d-6bf8-647ca5c04d57"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"wignerPlot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"wignerRepresentation", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"reducedCavity", "[", "1.3", "]"}], ",", " ", "4.0", ",", " ", 
     "55"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\<atom ignored: a fringeless mixture\>\""}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[94]:= ",
 CellID->471452856,ExpressionUUID->"5558c8fc-3d33-9e90-0367-e1a6b4c7e4fa"],

Cell["\<\
Two clean lobes, no fringes: the which-phase information has leaked into the \
atom, and averaging over it erases the coherence, exactly as tracing out any \
unwatched detector does.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1993504316,ExpressionUUID->"53291d47-a111-bd44-02d6-9520d0a507ae"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The cat appears only when the atom is ",
 StyleBox["read", "TI"],
 ", and the basis it is read in decides what comes out. Because ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "14460f59-6b0f-818e-3c7d-a7030ebbd3d4"],
 " rode with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
       RowBox[{"-", 
         StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]]}]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6afe19ed-5a5e-331e-1a85-90b75fe89e64"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "142f588d-e120-bc70-3dd5-51d690da075a"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
       RowBox[{"+", 
         StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]]}]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "029948d8-232c-2201-32a7-618256d9716b"],
 ", reading the atom directly in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
     "Ket"], ",", 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
      "Ket"], "}"}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4b1b5b6f-b43d-594b-7939-53493dc82b91"],
 " would reveal which phase the field took and collapse it to that one \
coherent state, a pointer and not a cat. The second Ramsey pulse, the \
analysis pulse, first rotates the atom into the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{"\[PlusMinus]"},
    "Ket"], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{
      TemplateBox[{
        StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
       "Ket"], "\[PlusMinus]", 
      TemplateBox[{
        StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
       "Ket"]}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], "/", 
    SqrtBox["2"]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "32f703b9-71e1-95eb-628c-9ae30795ff31"],
 " basis, so its outcome cannot say which phase; keep the runs where it comes \
out ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0c860bbc-8d1f-f590-34bd-a2e624abdffa"],
 " and that measurement projects the cavity into the even superposition ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"-", 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]]}]},
    "Ket"], "+", 
   TemplateBox[{
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"+", 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]]}]},
    "Ket"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1bab88a0-6539-d521-49a8-210a0ccdbc0b"],
 " of the two pointers, the cat; the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "74b37722-3fdc-1a4f-1c41-6e8cba696895"],
 " outcome gives the odd superposition ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"-", 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]]}]},
    "Ket"], "-", 
   TemplateBox[{
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"+", 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]}]]}]},
    "Ket"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "31781dc2-1028-33d4-6707-94aca1c2813e"],
 ". Condition on the atom after the analysis pulse. In symbols ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["conditionalCat",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["s", "TI"]}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}]}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["s", "TI"]},
     "Bra"], 
    StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["R", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"], 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["s", "TI"]},
      "Ket"], "/", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["Tr",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      StyleBox["[",
       SpanMaxSize->1], "\[CenterEllipsis]", 
      StyleBox["]",
       SpanMaxSize->1]}]}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2148b02c-d62e-5336-5777-2989e3db3e1c"],
 ": the analysis pulse ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["R", "TI"], "="}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "183293a6-0d60-7813-49c1-0a00a4154b79"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData["ramsey"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "61e1f3c1-eae0-3799-179e-eaaa8e9a9de3"],
 " on the entangled ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "20bddc2d-650e-8031-5042-d6770cb8d31b"],
 ", then the atom-",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["s", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7a437910-f355-55ba-2a71-715d86e03f80"],
 " block, renormalized:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1944276818,ExpressionUUID->"49429438-4a3e-974e-7f71-0e626fc8fd94"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"conditionalCat", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\[Phi]_", ",", " ", "s_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"r", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"ramsey", " ", ".", " ", 
        RowBox[{"entangle", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "ramsey", "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"blk", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"cavityGiven", "[", 
          RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "s"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"blk", "/", 
        RowBox[{"Tr", "[", "blk", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",\

 CellLabel->"In[95]:= ",
 CellID->524220529,ExpressionUUID->"07e2168c-1726-1a27-2d91-8fd6a2d3690d"],

Cell["Read its purity:", "Text",
 CellID->950216136,ExpressionUUID->"3540c51c-f580-c338-637f-dd59fc3aae02"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"purity", "[", 
  RowBox[{"conditionalCat", "[", 
   RowBox[{"1.3", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[96]:= ",
 CellID->338647958,ExpressionUUID->"684f0173-fe99-1571-1874-993cfb2c7c5b"],

Cell["\<\
Purity one: reading the atom has turned the mixture into a pure cat. Its \
Wigner function carries the fringes the mixture lacked:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->961910044,ExpressionUUID->"6e32c5a8-aee9-5273-17c1-dcf5ca9c2159"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"wignerPlot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"wignerRepresentation", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"conditionalCat", "[", 
      RowBox[{"1.3", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "4.0", ",", " ", 
     "55"}], "]"}], ",", 
   " ", "\"\<atom read as |e\[RightAngleBracket]: a cat, fringes and \
all\>\""}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[97]:= ",
 CellID->1465513701,ExpressionUUID->"607492e2-157b-ba0c-100b-0bcc9c0f0956"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The interference fringes are back. Making the cat and reading the atom are \
one act: no cat is inserted, it is conditioned into being by the atomic \
measurement. The phase ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7781757c-388d-abb9-1dbf-6d26b939f983"],
 " still sets the separation: small ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "566e7348-207a-dc95-7e16-6b12510ca6ff"],
 " leaves the two pointers close, large ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "39672ae7-82f4-b353-6f1c-c3c1368601b9"],
 " far apart."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1779278278,ExpressionUUID->"0c48aba4-6f27-6a39-3477-420e0ad23903"],

Cell["\<\
Now watch the conditional cat decohere under the leak. Sample three delays:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->332869652,ExpressionUUID->"2f62374d-f3df-131c-5511-af16866a7e66"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"harTimes", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "0.5", ",", " ", "1.0"}], "}"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",\

 CellLabel->"In[98]:= ",
 CellID->870462011,ExpressionUUID->"455ea632-3d4d-f0d3-7365-387cb4f9c239"],

Cell["\<\
Evolve the small-phase cat under the cavity leak across that span:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->770594293,ExpressionUUID->"1f0fb95c-030e-c889-4534-3106b6b89ad3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"harSmall", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"evolveODE", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"0", " ", "blankHar"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Gamma]har", "]"}], " ", "downHar"}], "}"}], ",",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{"conditionalCat", "[", 
      RowBox[{"0.5", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Max", "[", "harTimes", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[99]:= ",
 CellID->416617480,ExpressionUUID->"16268eae-a572-7912-3fdd-270bcc074878"],

Cell["and the large-phase cat the same way:", "Text",
